---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<Layout
  title="Curriculum Vitae — Anthony Djie | Full-Stack Software Engineer"
  description="CV & profil profesional Anthony Djie. Software Engineer berpengalaman membangun aplikasi web full-stack, REST API modular, dan mobile apps Flutter offline-first."
  lang="id"
>
  <header class="fixed top-3 sm:top-4 left-0 right-0 z-50 flex justify-center px-3 sm:px-4 pointer-events-none">
    <div class="pointer-events-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-4 sm:px-6 py-2 rounded-full bg-[#0d1017]/90 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/10 shadow-2xl shadow-black/60 font-mono text-xs">
      <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2 text-text-muted hover:text-white transition-colors">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
        </svg>
        <span>Ke Website Studio</span>
      </a>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-l border-white/10 pl-3">
        <span class="text-sky-300 font-bold">ID</span>
        <span class="text-white/20">/</span>
        <a href="/en/cv" class="text-text-muted hover:text-white transition-colors">EN</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="pt-24 sm:pt-32 pb-24 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="space-y-12">
      
      <!-- Profile Header -->
      <div class="border-b border-white/[0.08] pb-8 space-y-6">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <div>
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-sky-500/30 bg-sky-950/40 text-sky-300 text-xs font-mono mb-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
              <span>Terbuka untuk Posisi Full-Time Remote / Proyek Pilihan</span>
            </div>
            <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">Anthony Djie</h1>
            <p class="text-sky-300 font-mono text-sm mt-1">Full-Stack Software Engineer • Founder Djie Production</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <a
              href="/AnthonyDJie-CV-ID.pdf"
              target="_blank"
              download
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-sky-400 hover:bg-sky-300 text-slate-950 font-bold font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm transition-all shadow-lg shadow-sky-500/20 active:scale-95"
            >
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 10v6m0 0l-3-3m3 3l3-3m2 8H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z" />
              </svg>
              <span>Download CV (PDF)</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3 text-xs font-mono text-text-dim pt-2">
          <div><span class="text-zinc-500 block">Domisili:</span> Indonesia (UTC+7)</div>
          <div><span class="text-zinc-500 block">Email:</span> <a href="mailto:thony.djie@djieproduction.com" class="text-sky-300 hover:underline">thony.djie@djieproduction.com</a></div>
          <div><span class="text-zinc-500 block">GitHub:</span> <a href="https://github.com/ThonyBiersack" target="_blank" class="text-white hover:underline">@ThonyBiersack</a></div>
          <div><span class="text-zinc-500 block">LinkedIn:</span> <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/anthony-suryadjie-500063200" target="_blank" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">Anthony Suryadjie</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Professional Summary -->
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-400">Ringkasan Profesional</h2>
        <p class="text-text-muted text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          Software Engineer dengan spesialisasi pengembangan sistem web end-to-end (Node.js, Express, Astro) dan aplikasi mobile cross-platform (Flutter). Berpengalaman merancang arsitektur database relasional dan NoSQL (MongoDB, SQLite offline-first), menyusun RESTful API contract yang aman dengan Zod schema validation dan JWT authentication, serta mengoptimalkan performa deployment di cloud infrastructure (Cloudflare, Vercel).
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Technical Competencies -->
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-400">Keahlian Teknis</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/[0.08] bg-black/40 space-y-2">
            <h3 class="text-white font-semibold text-sm">Backend & APIs</h3>
            <p class="text-text-dim text-xs leading-relaxed">Node.js, Express.js (ESM), RESTful APIs, Zod Schema Validation, JWT, bcrypt, RBAC Middleware, MVC Architecture.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/[0.08] bg-black/40 space-y-2">
            <h3 class="text-white font-semibold text-sm">Frontend & UI</h3>
            <p class="text-text-dim text-xs leading-relaxed">Astro (Zero-JS Islands), Tailwind CSS, TypeScript, JavaScript (ES6+), Responsive Design, Accessibility (a11y).</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/[0.08] bg-black/40 space-y-2">
            <h3 class="text-white font-semibold text-sm">Mobile Development</h3>
            <p class="text-text-dim text-xs leading-relaxed">Flutter 3 SDK, Dart, Offline-First Architecture, ESC/POS Bluetooth Thermal Printing, Barcode Scanning (mobile_scanner).</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/[0.08] bg-black/40 space-y-2">
            <h3 class="text-white font-semibold text-sm">Database & Infrastructure</h3>
            <p class="text-text-dim text-xs leading-relaxed">MongoDB Atlas (Mongoose ODM), SQLite (sqflite WAL Mode), Cloudflare Pages & D1 SQL, Vercel, Git & GitHub.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Highlighted Production Projects -->
      <section class="space-y-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-400">Proyek Rekayasa Unggulan</h2>
        
        <div class="space-y-5">
          <!-- Project 1: TaskApp -->
          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.08] bg-black/40 space-y-3">
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-1">
              <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white">TaskApp — Platform Manajemen Tugas Full-Stack</h3>
              <span class="text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono">Live di Produksi</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-text-muted text-xs leading-relaxed">
              Platform produktivitas berbasis Express.js 5 dan MongoDB Atlas dengan integrasi Google Gemini AI (@google/genai) dan Mermaid.js diagram. Mengimplementasikan autentikasi JWT di HTTP-Only cookie, RBAC, dan validasi Zod.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 pt-1 text-xs font-mono">
              <a href="https://task.djieproduction.com" target="_blank" class="text-sky-400 hover:underline">Demo Live &nearr;</a>
              <a href="https://github.com/ThonyBiersack/taskApp" target="_blank" class="text-text-dim hover:text-white">GitHub Repo &nearr;</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Project 2: WarungKas -->
          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.08] bg-black/40 space-y-3">
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-1">
              <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white">WarungKas — POS Kasir Mobile Offline-First</h3>
              <span class="text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono">Flutter Native</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-text-muted text-xs leading-relaxed">
              Aplikasi kasir ritel lintas platform dengan database lokal SQLite WAL mode dan transaksi ACID. Dilengkapi integrasi printer thermal bluetooth (ESC/POS), pemindaian barcode kamera, dan ekspor invoice PDF.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 pt-1 text-xs font-mono">
              <a href="https://github.com/ThonyBiersack/warungkas" target="_blank" class="text-text-dim hover:text-white">GitHub Repo &nearr;</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Project 3: Bookshelf API -->
          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.08] bg-black/40 space-y-3">
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-1">
              <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white">Bookshelf REST API & Auth Engine</h3>
              <span class="text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono">13 Endpoints Terverifikasi</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-text-muted text-xs leading-relaxed">
              Arsitektur REST API modular berlapis (controllers, validators, middleware, models) dengan kepatuhan penuh standar HTTP status codes, sanitasi payload Zod, dan enkripsi bcrypt 12 rounds.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 pt-1 text-xs font-mono">
              <a href="https://github.com/ThonyBiersack/bookshelfAPI" target="_blank" class="text-text-dim hover:text-white">GitHub Repo &nearr;</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Project 4: Digital Invitation -->
          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.08] bg-black/40 space-y-3">
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-1">
              <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white">Digital Invitation Platform — Cloudflare Edge</h3>
              <span class="text-sky-300 text-xs font-mono">Astro + Cloudflare D1</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-text-muted text-xs leading-relaxed">
              Platform undangan interaktif dengan personalisasi URL slug instan tanpa bottleneck database, proteksi Turnstile CAPTCHA, rate-limiting server-side, dan pemutar musik lokal tanpa layout shift (CLS 0.00).
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Contact CTA -->
      <section class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-sky-500/30 bg-sky-950/20 text-center space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Tertarik Bekerja Sama atau Merekrut?</h2>
        <p class="text-text-muted text-sm max-w-xl mx-auto">
          Saya terbuka untuk diskusi teknis, wawancara kerja full-time, maupun kerja sama kontrak proyek.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 pt-2 font-mono text-xs">
          <a
            href="mailto:thony.djie@djieproduction.com"
            class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-sky-400 hover:bg-sky-300 text-slate-950 font-bold transition-all shadow-md active:scale-95"
          >
            Kirim Email Langsung
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/6283845641526"
            target="_blank"
            class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] hover:bg-white/[0.08] text-white font-semibold transition-colors"
          >
            Hubungi via WhatsApp
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="py-8 border-t border-white/[0.07] bg-[#07080a] text-xs font-mono text-text-dim text-center">
    <p>&copy; {currentYear} Anthony Djie • Djie Production. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>
</Layout>

